%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"fontSize": "18px"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant AC as AuthController
    participant AS as AuthService
    participant US as UsersService
    participant PR as PrismaService
    participant JWT as JwtService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over C,DB: LOGIN FLOW

    C->>AC: POST /auth/login {email, password}
    AC->>AS: login(dto)
    AS->>US: findByEmail(email)
    US->>PR: user.findUnique({where: {email}})
    PR->>DB: SELECT * FROM "User" WHERE email=?
    DB-->>PR: User | null
    PR-->>US: User
    US-->>AS: User
    alt User not found
        AS-->>C: 401 Credenciales invalidas
    end
    AS->>AS: bcrypt.compare(password, passwordHash)
    alt Wrong password
        AS-->>C: 401 Credenciales invalidas
    end
    AS->>JWT: signAsync({sub, email, role}, JWT_ACCESS_SECRET, 15m)
    JWT-->>AS: accessToken
    AS->>JWT: signAsync({sub, email, role}, JWT_REFRESH_SECRET, 7d)
    JWT-->>AS: refreshToken
    AS-->>AC: {accessToken, refreshToken, user}
    AC->>AC: Set-Cookie accessToken (HttpOnly, SameSite=strict)
    AC->>AC: Set-Cookie refreshToken (HttpOnly, Path=/auth/refresh)
    AC-->>C: 200 {message: "Login successful", user: {id, email, role}}

    Note over C,DB: REFRESH FLOW

    C->>AC: POST /auth/refresh
    Note over AC: Cookie refreshToken=<jwt>
    AC->>AS: refresh()
    AS->>JWT: verifyAsync(refreshToken, JWT_REFRESH_SECRET)
    alt Invalid or expired token
        AS-->>C: 401 Refresh token invalido
    end
    AS->>JWT: signAsync({sub, email, role}, JWT_ACCESS_SECRET, 15m)
    JWT-->>AS: newAccessToken
    AS-->>AC: Set-Cookie new accessToken (HttpOnly)
    AC-->>C: 200 {user: {id, email, role}}

    Note over C,DB: LOGOUT FLOW

    C->>AC: POST /auth/logout
    Note over AC: Cookie accessToken=<jwt>
    AC->>AS: logout()
    AS-->>AC: Clear accessToken + refreshToken cookies
    AC-->>C: 200 {message: "Logged out successfully"}

    Note over C,DB: PROFILE FLOW

    C->>AC: GET /auth/profile
    Note over AC: Cookie accessToken=<jwt>
    AC->>AS: profile(currentUser)
    AS-->>AC: {id, email, role, themePreference, createdAt, updatedAt}
    AC-->>C: 200 User profile